  "description": "As part of the Ryobi 18V ONE+™ system of over 200 cordless tools for the home, garden, automotive, crafting and much more, the Ryobi 18V ONE+™ RPD18BL2-0 Cordless Brushless Percussion Drill is the perfect combi drill for wood, steel, plastic and masonry drilling as well as screwdriving tasks. As part of the new Ryobi Brushless Series of cordless tools, this percussion drill is Ryobi’s most powerful yet with a patented motor design which uses stronger magnets and spins faster to produce up to 95Nm of torque. Incorporating advanced Brushless technology means more power, longer runtime and a longer life through its frictionless motor. Intelligent electronics constantly regulate the motor to optimise power and runtime. Its 13mm (½in) metal ratcheting chuck and 95Nm of torque allows the use of larger drill bits making it more versatile combi drill in a wider range of tasks. The integrated percussion mode provides faster drilling in harder materials such as brick, concrete and masonry. Featuring a two-speed gearbox with 24 torque settings for supercharged performance, this allows the user to adjust the power and speed to match the material and task. Supplied with side handle for increased control during larger drilling tasks. Using a 5ah battery (not included), the Ryobi RPD18BL2-0 can drill up to 375 16x50mm holes into wood on a single charge. This is a bare tool - battery and charger are not included.",
